        "dark": "EXIF: ISO 6400 (the body's auto-ISO ceiling), 1/400 s, exposure bias 0.0, night street shoot 2026-05-24 20:24. Gain ran out with no compensation dialled in; the shoot's night frames are the underexposure candidates. No aperture tag (f 0.0: manual lens). The live run records scout_stats to confirm or refute.",
        "bright": "EXIF: ISO 160, 1/1000 s, bias 0.0, daylight 2026-06-28 16:18. The fastest daylight shutter in the set; the highlight-clipping candidate. Manual lens (f 0.0).",
        "hero": "EXIF: ISO 200, 1/50 s, f/22, bias 0.0, 2026-06-28 15:49. README's own hero frame; an electronic lens (f-number recorded), so lens correction has data to work with.",
        "calib": "A second scratch copy of the hero, used only for `wb_calibrate` (it adds ~21 temperature history items to the frame it runs on).",
        "job": "Six E-M10 III frames outside the three edit frames, staged as a card and imported as one job."
      }
    },
