        "bright": "EXIF: NEX-5N, ISO 100, 1/1600 s (fastest shutter in the Sony set), bias 0.0, daylight 2026-07-15 14:42. Highlight-clipping candidate. Manual lens (f 0.0).",
        "hero": "EXIF: ILCE-7, ISO 2000, 1/60 s, f/3.5, bias 0.0. Electronic lens.",
